    skos:broader rockclassall:UMMER ;
    skos:definition "Olivine-melilitolite - A type of ultramafic-melilitic-rock. Melilitolite is the general name for coarse-grained melilitic rocks, and they are classified according to their melilite - olivine - clinopyroxene content. Olivine-melilitolite replaces the special varietal term kugdite. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 6.2 and fig. 28a."@en ;
