    skos:definition "Olivine-gabbronorite - A type of gabbro. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is a gabbro with plagioclase 5 - 85%, pyroxene 5 - 85% (both clino- and orthopyroxene >5%) and olivine 5 - 85% of plagioclase + pyroxene + olivine. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 5.1 and figs. 13, 14."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll> ;
    skos:narrower rockclassall:OGNB ;
    skos:notation "OLGBNO"@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Olivine-gabbronorite"@en ;
