    skos:broader rockclassall:PDT ;
    skos:definition "Dunite - A type of peridotite. In the Rock Classification Scheme, it is a peridotite with olivine >90%, pyroxene <10% and hornblende <10% of olivine + pyroxene + hornblende. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 5.1 and figs. 15, 16."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/EarthMaterialClass/RockClassAll> ;
